1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:05,710
Answer following questions below.

2
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:22,510
The opening paragraph introduces whom?

3
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:35,200
Answer: The opening paragraph introduces doctor Dang Van Ngu in general.

4
00:00:35,770 --> 00:01:01,800
The following paragraph tells what doctor Dang Van Ngu did?

5
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:18,310
Answer: The essay introduces first time milestone (year 1948) - great contribution of doctor Dang Van Ngu:

6
00:01:18,310 --> 00:01:34,040
bringing penicillin culture he made from Japan to Vietnam to make medicine to treat wounded soldiers.

7
00:01:34,530 --> 00:02:00,710
You read the next paragraph and tell what the next paragraph is about?

8
00:02:02,710 --> 00:02:18,510
Answer: The essay introduces second time milestone (year 1967) - next great contribution of doctor Dang Van Ngu:

9
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:32,880
he made anti-malaria medicine to treat malaria for our army.

10
00:02:33,420 --> 00:02:41,260
You read the ending paragraph and tell what the ending paragraph writes?

11
00:02:41,260 --> 00:02:57,170
Doctor Dang Van Ngu was posthumously awarded Ho Chi Minh Prize in Medicine field.

12
00:02:57,950 --> 00:03:23,910
His name is given to many schools, streets in Hanoi, Hue, Quang Binh, Ho Chi Minh City.

13
00:03:25,910 --> 00:03:40,370
Answer: The ending paragraph writes about the State honoring talent, dedication and merit of doctor Dang Van Ngu.

14
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:52,530
The ending paragraph also affirms doctor Dang Van Ngu still lives with us.

